## Integration acceptance

- Test typed and voice routes separately with processing local/remote scope accurately disclosed.
- Verify ordinary navigation, reloading and theme changes do not start listening or submit a command. Separately test an explicitly chosen, clearly labelled native voice shortcut with `start_listening`; do not disable that supported behaviour merely to apply the theme.
- Test ambiguity, microphone denial and request timeout without inventing recognition or physical success.

Record actual environment, versions, state, method and result using the [native task accessibility matrix](native-task-accessibility.html). Source review and a local example do not establish physical execution, screen-reader usability or live compatibility.

